    "Using a mouse? Turn on AssistiveTouch (Settings > Accessibility > Touch), then reopen Madeira.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maus? AssistiveTouch einschalten (Einstellungen > Bedienungshilfen > Tippen), dann Madeira neu öffnen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Usas un ratón? Activa AssistiveTouch (Ajustes > Accesibilidad > Tocar) y vuelve a abrir Madeira."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "마우스를 쓰나요? AssistiveTouch를 켠 뒤(설정 > 손쉬운 사용 > 터치) Madeira를 다시 여세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usando um mouse? Ative o AssistiveTouch (Ajustes > Acessibilidade > Toque) e abra o Madeira de novo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Мышь? Включите AssistiveTouch (Настройки > Универсальный доступ > Касание) и снова откройте Madeira."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用鼠标？请打开「辅助触控」（设置 > 辅助功能 > 触控），然后重新打开 Madeira。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
